# Quantity stepper

Quantity Stepper joins decrease, number input, and increase actions into one bounded control. Users can press either action, type a value, or use native keyboard controls. Buttons become unavailable automatically at `min` and `max`.

Use it for small, discrete quantities such as cart items or seats. Use a regular number input when the range is large or direct entry is the primary interaction.

